---
import { PageHero } from '@oimlsmart/site-shell'
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro'
import { SITE } from '../data/site-meta'
---

<Shell title={SITE.title} description={SITE.description}>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-14">
    <PageHero
      eyebrow="OIML SMART · Component 5"
      title="The SMI Simulation"
      lede="Faithful, scriptable simulations of SMART Measuring Instruments — Simulated SMART Measuring Instrument Twins (SSTs) — so testers learn the workflow and developers integrate without hardware."
      logo={{ name: 'sst', alt: 'The SMI Simulation logo.', base: `${SITE.url}/img/components` }}
    />
    <section class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="border border-rule rounded-lg p-6 bg-paper-raised">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">The same twin surface</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">An SST answers the identical GraphQL a physical SMART instrument answers: IS, HAS, DOES, with serve times and freshness rules. A client cannot tell the difference until it is told.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-rule rounded-lg p-6 bg-paper-raised">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Realistic physics</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">Load cells creep and drift with temperature cycles; gas analyzers respond per channel; the environment (temperature, humidity, pressure) acts on the indication. The differences after a temperature cycle are configurable.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-rule rounded-lg p-6 bg-paper-raised">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">The console</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">An IOS-style terminal into the simulated world: place load 40, set the chamber to 60 °C and 100 % humidity, wait five simulated minutes, read the indication back. A test method, rehearsed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-rule rounded-lg p-6 bg-paper-raised">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Standalone by design</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">One command boots an instrument with every surface open: the twin endpoint, the world endpoint, the console, the bench. No platform checkout, no hardware, no lab.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <p class="mt-10 text-sm"><a href="/sst/docs/" class="text-accent font-medium">Read the SMI Simulation documentation →</a></p>
  </main>
</Shell>
